      "content": "thanks, this is a good start. it's clean and readable.\n\nactually, one thing—i just ran this through the structural density checker and the score came back a bit low. i know i said not to obsess over it, but our manager is really pushing for \"comprehensive coverage\" metrics this quarter. \n\ncan you expand this section? specifically, can you go into more detail about the SDK installation and the actual authentication headers? i need it to be more thorough. just try to keep it professional and actually useful, don't just make it a wall of bullets, but it does need to be more detailed and structured so the score isn't so low.",
